    "normalizedRequirement": "Compute C_spex = max(0.3, 0.7*(1 - ((4*EAR)/Z)^3)) and Q_sex_kNm = max(C_LE0.8, 0.8*C_TE0.8)*C_spex*F_ex_kN, unless an appropriate stress analysis directly determines the maximum spindle torque.",
